[SCENE SPECIFIC ACTION AND SETTING - 200-400 words describing the problem moment, environment, pose, facial expression, NO PRODUCT]

Camera: Handheld smartphone POV, {{ $json.videoStrategy.aspectRatio }}, natural lighting, authentic UGC aesthetic. Resolution: 2K, output: PNG.",

      "script": "[Natural conversational narration for 10 seconds, expressing frustration about the problem]",

      "characterConsistencyNotes": [
        "MUST have {{ $json.characterPhysical.facialStructure.faceShape }} face",
        "MUST have {{ $json.characterPhysical.hairSpecification.colorExact }} hair at {{ $json.characterPhysical.hairSpecification.lengthMeasurement }}",
        "MUST wear {{ $json.characterPhysical.stylePresentation.clothingExact }}",
